Description: Plasma Login Manager, locally packaged without activation
 Plasma's Wayland login greeter, wallpaper host, daemon, PAM integration,
 and System Settings module. This preparation package does not select a
 display manager or start, stop, enable, or restart services. Selection and
 activation require a separate, explicit administrative operation.
